.27],[1723334400,44.36],[1723939200,-13.58],[1724544000,-7.41],[1725148800,43.95],[1725753600,24.79],[1726358400,14.13],[1726963200,-37.36],[1727568000,-37.36],[1749340800,105.85],[1749945600,-57.69],[1750550400,11.36],[1751155200,38.01],[1751760000,19.29],[1752364800,26.42],[1752969600,-10.75],[1753574400,-14.09],[1754179200,18.85],[1754784000,-23.81],[1755388800,-25.12],[1755993600,22.28],[1756598400,36.9],[1757203200,47.96],[1757808000,-0.44],[1758412800,6.97],[1759017600,-3.3],[1780790400,-9.89],[1781395200,-18.45],[1782000000,-47.68],[1782604800,-46.93],[1783209600,-27.55],[1783814400,45.39],[1784419200,-51.1],[1785024000,-0.74],[1785628800,1.5],[1786233600,6.54],[1786838400,-16.23],[1787443200,-16.22],[1788048000,-19.28],[1788652800,-17.94],[1789257600,-36.29],[1789862400,-17.36],[1790467200,-13.81],[1791072000,48.54]]}]}],"qna":[{"question":"What does the Deviation from Normal Rainfall data represent?","answer":"This data represents the progress in rainfall on a weekly cumulative basis and the deviation from normal rainfall, during the South-west Monsoon season (June to September) in India.^'Normal' rainfall is defined as the long-term average of rainfall during these months, typically calculated over a 30-50 year period. The data expressed in percentage measures the difference between the actual rainfall received and the normal rainfall for the period, providing a clear indication of whether the monsoon season has brought more or less rainfall than usual.^LPA is the average rainfall received over a long-term period, typically over 50 years. LPA serves as a baseline to assess the current year's rainfall. It helps in understanding whether the rainfall is above, below, or at par with the average expectations."},{"question":"What is the significance of Deviation from Normal Rainfall data?","answer":"$2a"},{"question":"How to interpret the Deviation from Normal Rainfall data?","answer":"The data is expressed in percentage terms. For instance, if the LPA is 1000 mm and the actual rainfall is 900 mm, the data might show this as 90% of LPA. A value of 100% indicates average rainfall, above 100% signifies above-average rainfall, and below 100% indicates below-average rainfall.^Positive deviation (above-normal rainfall) can enhance crop production, but excessive rainfall might lead to flooding and damage to crops. Negative deviation (below-normal rainfall) can lead to drought, adversely affecting crops and reducing yields.^The impact of rainfall data should be interpreted in the context of the specific crops grown in the area, seasonal and regional variations, and its distribution throughout the year.^Rainfall data might influence agricultural output, commodity prices,inflation, food security, and government policies such as drought relief measures or subsidies."}],"related":[{"slug":"annual-rainfall-lpa","title":"Annual Rainfall (% of LPA)"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-food","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation - Food"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-food-rural","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation - Food Rural"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-miscellaneous-rural","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation- Miscellaneous Rural"},{"slug":"domestic-tractor-sales","title":"Domestic Tractor Sales"},{"slug":"exports-agricultural-allied-products","title":"Exports - Agricultural & Allied Products"},{"slug":"fertiliser-sales","title":"Fertiliser Sales"},{"slug":"foodgrain-stocks","title":"Foodgrain Stocks"},{"slug":"kharif-sowing-progress","title":"Kharif Sowing Progress"},{"slug":"rabi-sowing-progress","title":"Rabi Sowing Progress"},{"slug":"reservoir-level-10-year-average","title":"Reservoir Level (vs 10Y Avg)"},{"slug":"wholesale-price-index-wpi-inflation-food","title":"Wholesale Price Index (WPI) Inflation - Food"}],"title":"South-west Monsoon Rainfall: Deviation from Normal","description":"This data represents the progress in rainfall on a weekly cumulative basis and the deviation from normal rainfall, during the South-west Monsoon season (June to September) in India.","headline":{},"source":null,"source_url":null,"date_modified":"2026-10-04","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:10:59+00:00"}